  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-herdr",
      "text": "> **English** | [简体中文](README.zh-CN.md)\n\nHerdr control-plane plugin for [DeepSeek Harness (DSH)](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness): observe and drive [Herdr](https://herdr.dev) — a terminal workspace manager for AI coding agents — directly from DSH sessions."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **Control plane** — 19 `herdr_*` tools over Herdr's Unix-domain socket (snapshot, agents, panes, workspaces, layout, notifications)\n- **Session-scoped UI** — Herdr tab and side panel show only the current session's workspace; hidden outside Herdr mode\n- **Herdr mode** — create a session in Herdr mode to get a dedicated workspace that lives and dies with the session"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Prerequisites: a DSH profile (e.g. `web`) and a running Herdr server. The plugin talks to the local Herdr socket; the panel can start the server from `PATH` if needed.\n\n```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "npm (published as dsh-plugin-herdr)",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-plugin-herdr"
    },
    {
      "section": "local directory",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /path/to/dsh-plugin-herdr"
    },
    {
      "section": "tarball (pnpm pack output)",
      "text": "pnpm pack\ndsh plugin --profile web add ./dsh-plugin-herdr-*.tgz"
    },
    {
      "section": "git",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:sunny0826/dsh-plugin-herdr\n```\n\nRestart the profile after install. Verify with `dsh plugin --profile web list`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Uninstall",
